pulation with a 2015 United Nations estimate of 2,344,000. In 1950, the population of Port Harcourt was 59,752. Port Harcourt has grown by 150,844 since 2015, which represents a 4.99% annual change.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Pitakwa.jpg/330px-Pitakwa.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Port_Harcourt"},"twins":[],"climate":{"temp":[25.3,26.6,26.9,26.8,26.5,25.6,25,24.8,25.2,25.6,26.2,25.8],"rain":[26,50,103,155,208,315,324,334,397,249,131,29],"cloud":[56,66,82,82,81,87,89,89,89,83,70,56]}}